/// For the Team Analytics report (AC-9).
///
/// A manager sees their whole reporting line, direct and indirect, plus their
/// own record. The filter lands on the Manager Hierarchy bridge and reaches
/// Employee through that relationship's bidirectional security filtering.
///
/// This mirrors Dataverse Manager hierarchy security. The two are enforced
/// independently, so a change to the reporting tree must flow to both - which it
/// does, because both derive from Employee[Manager] (ARCHITECTURE.md 6.3).
///
/// Assign the Skills-Managers Entra security group to this role.
role 'Manager Team'
	modelPermission: read

	tablePermission 'Manager Hierarchy' = 'Manager Hierarchy'[Manager Email] = LOWER ( USERPRINCIPALNAME () )
